   "text": "Kairali 周边热门景点 - 距疗愈村 10 公里以内",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_580365fa1059e72655cb",
   "sourceHash": "580365fa1059e72655cb0709cb116c75deb2ce4be3df6286751be5ec927681f8",
   "text": "探索 Kairali 周边的文化与历史景点，从古老寺庙到提普堡，一窥喀拉拉邦丰富的文化遗产与传统。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_929925f1862120628c72",
   "sourceHash": "929925f1862120628c727ac3bccb3e610f79a8689cdf6ef1a4baded6025d9b2e",
   "text": "景点 - 10 公里及以内",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
